	<#f4cf72>VICTOR NAGAEV</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>MOVEMENT & DEFENSE</>
Forward Dash		_F_F
Back Dash		_B_B
Super Jump		_D_U
Quick Stand		_D
<#aab8c7>Press Down as you hit the ground.</>
High Parry		_F
Low Parry		_D
<#aab8c7>Tap the direction just before the attack hits.</>
Personal Action		^Z_+^C
<#aab8c7>Boosts attacks performed immediately afterward.</>
<#aab8c7>While stunned, rapidly change directions</>
<#aab8c7>to recover faster.</>

<#72c8eb>THROWS & UNIQUE ATTACKS</>
Body Slam		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close range; optionally hold Forward or Back.</>
Headbutt		_B_+^Z
Sleeper Hold		_B_+^Z
<#aab8c7>Sleeper Hold: stand behind your opponent.</>
Chop		_F_+^Y
Lariat		_F_+^Z
Flying Cross Chop		_D_+^Z
<#aab8c7>During a neutral or forward jump.</>
Leap Attack		^Y_+^B

<#72c8eb>TARGET COMBOS</>
Crouching Light Kick > Medium Kick		_D_+^A > _D_+^B
Crouching Light Kick > Heavy Kick		_D_+^A > _D_+^C

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>EX specials require 400 power; watch the flashing meter.</>
<#aab8c7>Flash Chop uses Punches; other EX specials use Kicks.</>
<#f4cf72>SC</> <#aab8c7>means the move can cancel into a Super Art.</>
<#aab8c7>Hold the indicated direction to charge the move.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Flash Chop <#aab8c7>[EX, SC]</>		_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Air Knee Smash <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_F_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
Air Stampede <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D (hold) _U_+[^A/^B/^C]
Slash Elbow <#aab8c7>[EX, SC]</>		_B (hold) _F_+[^A/^B/^C]
Power Bomb		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Back Drop		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Back Drop: stand behind your opponent.</>
Spiral D.D.T.		_B_DB_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]

<#72c8eb>SUPER ARTS — 1 STOCK</>
I. Hyper Bomb		360 motion_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
II. Boomerang Raid		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
III. Stun Gun Headbutt		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>When all Super Arts are enabled:</>
Stun Gun Headbutt		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
